163
00:17:44,200 --> 00:17:46,320
So he'd come eat here often.

164
00:17:49,520 --> 00:17:50,560
I'm sorry.

165
00:17:53,400 --> 00:17:56,200
And then after Chee's mother passed,

166
00:17:56,280 --> 00:17:58,120
he became a completely different person.

167
00:17:59,320 --> 00:18:02,400
And then Pan disappeared shortly after
on top of that

168
00:18:03,040 --> 00:18:04,720
Officer, you know how it is with men,

169
00:18:04,800 --> 00:18:07,600
