if everyone in your gang dies.

207
00:20:33,160 --> 00:20:34,720
You guys are a waste of space.

208
00:21:05,840 --> 00:21:07,080
Don't stress about it.

209
00:21:07,560 --> 00:21:08,640
Don't stress about it.

210
00:21:08,720 --> 00:21:09,880
