237
00:22:25,280 --> 00:22:27,160
WARIPASOP DISTRICT
PROVINCIAL POLICE STATION

238
00:22:58,280 --> 00:22:59,560
Any progress on the case?

239
00:23:01,240 --> 00:23:02,880
