240
00:23:07,160 --> 00:23:08,160
You guys continue working.

241
00:23:08,680 --> 00:23:10,720
-Yes, sir.
-Alright, this way please.

242
00:23:22,640 --> 00:23:23,640
What is it, Lieutenant?

243
00:23:24,840 --> 00:23:26,440
