to witness his mom's body.

255
00:23:57,600 --> 00:23:58,600
Mom.

256
00:24:13,520 --> 00:24:15,560
Mom. Mom! Mom!

257
00:24:17,000 --> 00:24:18,800
Mom!
Mom.

258
00:24:18,880 --> 00:24:20,200
Mom. Mom!

259
00:24:23,360 --> 00:24:24,640
Someone help!

260
00:24:24,720 --> 00:24:25,840
Hey!

261
00:24:25,920 --> 00:24:26,960
Mom!

262
00:24:27,800 --> 00:24:29,000
