and listen to me first.

280
00:25:03,400 --> 00:25:04,400
No.

281
00:25:04,480 --> 00:25:06,280
If you're going to ask me
things like this again,

282
00:25:06,640 --> 00:25:08,480
don't bother showing up here again.

283
00:25:08,880 --> 00:25:10,840
Chee had never done anything to anyone!

284
00:25:11,120 --> 00:25:12,640
The dead are already dead!

285
00:25:22,280 --> 00:25:23,280
Well,

286
00:25:23,680 --> 00:25:26,360
I don't know what to say.
I'm really sorry, Mr. Chawin.

287
00:25:27,040 --> 00:25:28,320
It won't happen again.

288
00:25:29,240 --> 00:25:30,360
Excuse me.

289
00:25:31,880 --> 00:25:33,680
I already told you about Chawin, right?

290
00:25:34,040 --> 00:25:35,680
I was just doing my job.

291
00:25:36,120 --> 00:25:37,840
I've never stopped you
from doing anything.

292
00:25:37,920 --> 00:25:39,560
But why were you messing with his family?

293
00:25:40,120 --> 00:25:41,320
How is it your business?

294
00:25:42,480 --> 00:25:43,520
Don't let this happen again.

295
00:25:44,520 --> 00:25:45,960
Or else you'll get into trouble.

296
00:26:00,320 --> 00:26:01,640
What are you reading?

297
00:26:02,720 --> 00:26:04,560
Just a normal fashion magazine, Mom.

298
00:26:05,880 --> 00:26:07,560
The kind you never let me read.

299
00:26:08,040 --> 00:26:09,040
Huh?

300
00:26:10,200 --> 00:26:11,600
Why don't I remember that?

301
00:26:13,600 --> 00:26:15,200
You never remember anything, Mom.

302
00:26:15,840 --> 00:26:18,640
Not when you hit Pin or yell at me.

303
00:26:22,560 --> 00:26:23,600
I'm really sorry.

304
00:26:26,560 --> 00:26:28,200
I really didn't know.

305
00:26:28,600 --> 00:26:29,680
It's alright, Mom.

306
00:26:30,760 --> 00:26:31,760
Because

307
00:26:32,160 --> 00:26:33,520
I'm not here anymore.

308
00:26:43,160 --> 00:26:45,640
I'm sorry. I'm really sorry.

309
00:26:48,320 --> 00:26:49,760
I'm sorry.

310
00:27:17,120 --> 00:27:18,120
How should we do it?

311
00:27:18,640 --> 00:27:19,640
Yeah.

312
00:27:23,200 --> 00:27:25,000
Why don't you try sitting?

313
00:27:28,240 --> 00:27:29,240
Is this okay?

314
00:27:29,320 --> 00:27:30,320
Yeah.

315
00:27:31,280 --> 00:27:32,640
Should you lean a little to the side?

316
00:27:32,720 --> 00:27:33,760
Ah-ha.

317
00:27:34,600 --> 00:27:35,760
One. Two.

318
00:27:45,520 --> 00:27:46,520
What are you two doing?

319
00:27:50,040 --> 00:27:51,040
And what is that?

320
00:27:51,560 --> 00:27:52,560
Huh?

321
00:27:52,920 --> 00:27:54,000
Dad's camera?

322
00:27:54,080 --> 00:27:55,200
Who told you to use it?

323
00:27:57,120 --> 00:27:59,800
Mom, I'm just playing around with Pin.

324
00:28:02,720 --> 00:28:05,120
And what are you wearing?

325
00:28:05,200 --> 00:28:06,880
Huh?
What?

326
00:28:06,960 --> 00:28:08,400
Why is it so skimpy?

327
00:28:09,920 --> 00:28:12,000
You brought this
for your big sister to wear?

328
00:28:12,880 --> 00:28:15,160
Pan put it on herself.
I'm just taking photos.

329
00:28:15,400 --> 00:28:16,640
That's not true.

330
00:28:16,720 --> 00:28:18,640
I've never bought
this kind of clothes for her.

331
00:28:20,960 --> 00:28:23,600
Do you think your big sister
is a lowly woman? Huh?

332
00:28:23,680 --> 00:28:25,440
Mom! Pan!

333
00:28:25,520 --> 00:28:28,000
Mom! I'm just taking photos of Pan!

334
00:28:28,080 --> 00:28:30,440
Taking photos?
Why can't you wear normal clothes?

335
00:28:30,520 --> 00:28:31,880
I'm hurt! Pan!

336
00:28:31,960 --> 00:28:33,320
Pan, please tell her!

337
00:28:33,400 --> 00:28:35,680
Wearing it because you want to?

338
00:28:35,920 --> 00:28:37,840
You want to use the camera
and you just use it?

339
00:28:37,920 --> 00:28:39,480
Pan!

340
00:28:40,280 --> 00:28:44,200
Mom, enough! I'm hurt!
Enough! I'm hurt! Pan!

341
00:28:44,280 --> 00:28:45,960
Don't do it next time!

342
00:29:20,280 --> 00:29:22,000
Chee is gone now.

343
00:29:23,720 --> 00:29:25,320
I'll leave everything to you, Que.

344
00:31:06,040 --> 00:31:08,080
SISTER RAY CHILL CHILL STREET FOOD

345
00:31:28,680 --> 00:31:34,520
Cheers! More please. More. Thank you!

346
00:31:35,000 --> 00:31:36,000
Me too!

347
00:31:36,080 --> 00:31:37,760
Let me go take order first.

348
00:31:39,840 --> 00:31:40,880
Come back quickly!

349
00:31:47,800 --> 00:31:49,000
Here's your menu,

350
00:31:49,440 --> 00:31:50,600
what would you like to order?

351
00:31:51,160 --> 00:31:52,640
Spicy minced pork salad and beer.

352
00:31:53,120 --> 00:31:55,440
We ran out of pork,
can you wait for someone to deliver?

353
00:31:55,760 --> 00:31:56,960
Would you like something else first?

354
00:31:57,040 --> 00:31:58,200
There's beef and duck salad.

355
00:32:00,080 --> 00:32:01,240
Beer and nuts then.

356
00:32:01,320 --> 00:32:02,760
Alright. Please wait.

357
00:32:12,600 --> 00:32:14,920
Someone killed Jo.

358
00:32:15,480 --> 00:32:16,480
Here's beer and nuts.

359
00:32:16,560 --> 00:32:18,120
Two members of our gang got killed.

360
00:32:18,520 --> 00:32:21,160
Could it be the same person
who killed Chee?

361
00:32:21,360 --> 00:32:24,840
If we caught them, we can get 10 million!

362
00:32:25,360 --> 00:32:27,560
Damn, I miss Cheei.

363
00:32:27,640 --> 00:32:28,920
Why do you even miss him?

364
00:32:29,000 --> 00:32:30,640
Chee's already dead.

365
00:32:30,880 --> 00:32:31,880
Now,

366
00:32:32,240 --> 00:32:34,720
I can be the one to rule here.

367
00:32:34,800 --> 00:32:35,920
Woo!

368
00:32:36,360 --> 00:32:39,080
Damn, it's so satisfying, you know?

369
00:32:39,480 --> 00:32:41,920
-His dad is powerful but so what?
-Yeah.

370
00:32:42,000 --> 00:32:44,480
Look at my dad, also a soldier!

371
00:32:44,760 --> 00:32:47,080
Yeah! Don't let 'em win!

372
00:32:48,520 --> 00:32:49,720
Did you know?

373
00:32:50,120 --> 00:32:51,360
Chee's woman,

374
00:32:51,440 --> 00:32:52,440
Pan,

375
00:32:52,520 --> 00:32:54,200
I already slept with her!

376
00:32:59,680 --> 00:33:01,760
Hey.
It's Pan's sister.

377
00:33:04,440 --> 00:33:05,880
So what?

378
00:33:07,000 --> 00:33:08,200
Oh hey, Pin.

379
00:33:08,960 --> 00:33:11,080
Your mom allowed you
to drink like others now?

380
00:33:11,960 --> 00:33:13,360
You shut your mouth, M.

381
00:33:14,360 --> 00:33:15,360
Shut my mouth?

382
00:33:16,240 --> 00:33:17,880
Can you shut your mouth
and open something else?

383
00:33:17,960 --> 00:33:19,120
Woo!

384
00:33:19,200 --> 00:33:20,720
Look at her, she's grown up

385
00:33:20,800 --> 00:33:22,400
and just as busty as her sister!

386
00:33:26,080 --> 00:33:28,080
What's wrong with you?
I'm just joking around.

387
00:33:28,160 --> 00:33:29,320
Go play with your mom!

388
00:33:30,600 --> 00:33:32,360
You think you're tough? Huh?

389
00:33:32,440 --> 00:33:33,920
You think you're tough?

390
00:33:34,000 --> 00:33:35,680
Calm down!

391
00:33:35,760 --> 00:33:37,080
Stop!

392
00:33:37,160 --> 00:33:39,320
If you don't stop,
I'll call the police.

393
00:33:39,400 --> 00:33:40,720
None of your business!

394
00:33:40,800 --> 00:33:42,280
Calm down. Easy there.
Don't fight with women.

395
00:33:42,360 --> 00:33:43,360
Let's go drink instead.

396
00:33:43,440 --> 00:33:45,480
Enough, believe me. Let's go drink.

397
00:33:45,560 --> 00:33:46,640
Let's drink.

398
00:33:46,720 --> 00:33:47,760
Stinks of pork!

399
00:33:55,520 --> 00:33:57,280
Easy there.

400
00:33:58,600 --> 00:34:00,280
Sister, two spicy minced pork salad.

401
00:34:01,080 --> 00:34:02,280
More ice, please.

402
00:35:01,320 --> 00:35:02,400
What's wrong?

403
00:35:06,400 --> 00:35:07,920
A wound from chopping pigs up.

404
00:35:10,040 --> 00:35:11,160
Where's your ring?

405
00:35:13,600 --> 00:35:14,800
I don't know either.

406
00:35:19,160 --> 00:35:21,440
I'll get you a change of clothes,
wait a bit.

407
00:35:35,400 --> 00:35:37,000
What are you doing?

408
00:35:37,640 --> 00:35:40,000
Why are you shy? We're both women here.

409
00:36:04,360 --> 00:36:06,280
-Ouch!
-Hold still.

410
00:36:06,560 --> 00:36:07,640
It hurts.

411
00:36:08,200 --> 00:36:09,240
You're not going to die from it.

412
00:36:19,480 --> 00:36:20,560
Your shirt is also dirty.

413
00:36:20,640 --> 00:36:21,640
Why don't you get changed too?

414
00:36:25,920 --> 00:36:27,520
Hey, right here?

415
00:36:28,160 --> 00:36:29,160
Mmm.

416
00:36:32,520 --> 00:36:33,560
I'll wait outside.

417
00:37:45,320 --> 00:37:46,440
Hey!

418
00:37:46,520 --> 00:37:47,720
Pin!

419
00:37:48,160 --> 00:37:49,160
Are you alright?

420
00:37:50,000 --> 00:37:51,240
Nothing's wrong.

421
00:37:51,320 --> 00:37:52,400
I just kicked the edge of the table.

422
00:39:18,600 --> 00:39:19,600
What the?

423
00:39:29,560 --> 00:39:30,880
What the hell is that?

424
00:39:40,880 --> 00:39:42,880
Ouch! Ahh!

425
00:39:47,040 --> 00:39:48,040
Help!

426
00:40:09,560 --> 00:40:10,760
Help!
